sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Review inbox query and response
  accDescr: The server checks the session and installation, validates filters, and selects the page before joining its latest verification summaries. PostgreSQL limits each verification lookup to one row and the review note to 160 characters. Denied access clears private rows and invalidates old requests, temporary failures preserve the last good page. CSV and JSON exports reuse that loaded snapshot without another query.
  autonumber
  participant UI as Browser inbox
  participant API as GET /api/reviews
  participant Auth as Session boundary
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Map as Projection

  UI->>API: Filters + opaque cursor, session cookie
  API->>Auth: Require live OAuth configuration
  Auth->>DB: Session hash, expiry and installation membership
  DB-->>Auth: Current numeric identity and role
  alt Missing or revoked access
    Auth-->>API: 401 or 403
    API-->>UI: Access denied, no query results
    UI->>UI: Clear private rows and exports<br/>Invalidate older requests
  else Authorized
    Auth-->>API: Trusted installation ID
    API->>API: Validate filters and cursor<br/>Keep fixed ordering
    alt Invalid query
      API-->>UI: 400, no result query
    else Valid query
      API->>DB: One parameterized statement<br/>Tenant scope + keyset, page first, limit 21
      DB->>DB: For each selected run:<br/>LATERAL latest verification, LIMIT 1<br/>Generated summary + short review note
      alt Database unavailable or deadline exceeded
        DB-->>API: Query failure
        API-->>UI: Sanitized 503, no demo fallback
        UI->>UI: Keep last good page<br/>with its applied filters
      else Query succeeds
        DB-->>API: At most 21 rows
        API->>Map: Validate summary versions and shape<br/>First 20, cursor from last returned row
        Map-->>API: Counts, outcomes, owner, short note<br/>No source excerpt or sandbox output
        API-->>UI: 200 + no-store + nextCursor
        UI->>UI: Validate live response<br/>Replace snapshot, ignore stale requests
        opt User exports this page
          UI->>UI: CSV / JSON from loaded rows<br/>Include applied filters + snapshot time<br/>No additional server query
        end
      end
    end
  end
